blocks.en:
Table S7: Learned gate versus fixed fusion weights. Results with a fixed seed and three epochs. Each fixed row replaces
the learned semantic-path weight w w with a constant. F: mean AUROC over CelebDF, DF-TIMIT, UADFV, HiFiFace;
G: mean AUROC over GenVideo, DF26; Avg.: equal mean over the seven evaluation datasets (%). Best results are bold and second-best results are underlined in each column.

blocks.zh:
表S7:学习门对固定聚变重量。 有固定种子和三个纪元的结果。 每个固定行替换
有常数的语义-路径重力ww。 F:指AUROC凌驾于CelebDF,DF-TIMIT,UADFV,HiFiFace之上;
G:指AUROC凌驾于GenVideo之上,DF26;Avg.:在7个评价数据集上等值平均值(%). 最佳成果是大胆的,并在每栏中强调次佳成果。
